		"$:/plugins/euth/drawers/history": {
			"text": "V 0.1.1 - 2026-11-12

* Code cleanup;
* Drawer items now can be defined with a filter (e.g. `[all[shadows+tiddlers]tag[$:/tags/SideBar]!has[draft.of]reverse[]]`).

V 0.1.0 - 2026-11-06

* Refactored the plugin's inner structure using the standard tabs Macro. Now the drawers can have multiple tabs.

---

V 0.0.7 - 2026-11-04

* Fixed a typo in `$:/plugins/euth/drawers/settings`

V 0.0.6 - 2026-10-29

* Unset the Sidebar's position, when placed inside a drawer. Now `$:/core/ui/PageTemplate/sidebar` can be put into a drawer directly.

V 0.0.5 - 2026-10-28

* Handles move to the inside when width is close to 100%; 
* Moved the left drawer's scrollbar to the left;
* Added an icon (<a href="https://thenounproject.com/icon/archive-845904/" target="_blank" title="archive">"Archive"</a> by Gregor Cresnar from <a href="https://thenounproject.com/browse/icons/term/archive/" target="_blank" title="archive Icons">Noun Project</a> (CC BY 3.0)).

V 0.0.4 - 2026-10-27

* Added shadows and corrected the tabs styling.

V 0.0.3 - 2026-10-27

* Moved settings to individual tiddlers under `$:/plugins/euth/drawers/config/`

V 0.0.2 - 2026-10-26

* Fixed: 
** the top part of the drawer content hidden beneath a top menu bar;
** the drawer preventing the use of the sidebar scrollbar on desktops.

V 0.0.1 - 2026-10-24

* Initial release",
